    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n63859" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λόμβαι:</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἱ τῇ Ἀρτέμιδι θυσιῶν ἄρχουσαι, ἀπὸ
			τῆς κατὰ τὴν παιδιὰν σκευῆς. οἱ γὰρ φάλητες οὕτω
			καλοῦνται</span>, <i><span class="en">
			Hsch.
		</span></i>
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λομβούς:</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοὺς ἀπεσκολυμμένους</span>, Id. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λομβρός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, in 
			Comp.
		
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λομβρότερον</span>, name of an in decent
		dance, <i><span class="en">
			Poll.
			4.105
		</span></i>. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λόνδις:</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βωμολόχος, εἴρων</span>, <i><span class="en">
			Hsch.
		</span></i></div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
